# Scenario 'monkey_blank': seeded pseudo-random button mashing (seed 7) starting from a factory-fresh cartridge and a blank
# Mobile Adapter (fake Internet + synthetic web). Deterministic (PRNG inside the harness; presses recorded in monkey_blank.txt).
# Purpose: reach the registration wizard's error/validation paths that the guided scenarios skip.
